      "summary": "Over 28 years of business and corporate experience at an executive level, with world class multi-national corporations across Real Estate, Information Technology, Shipping, Logistics, Banking, Financial Services & Insurance Industry, I have added significant strategic business value by steering large scale complex business operations, led business transformation and enterprise IT solutions projects, driven business growth and profitability, managed large and diverse cultural teams, in a highly matrixed environment, within a highly global set up.<br><br>Executive Level / Management Board: Actively contributed to entity level topics such as legal, risk, compliance, information security, data privacy, contracting, with continued focus and understanding of several contemporary topics primarily on regulatory environment, technological advancements, etc. Demonstrated experience of business case proposals, participated in RFPs, analysed return on investments, legal structure and regulatory requirements due to local laws, handled cross border transition projects, audit and control environment, etc.<br><br>GBS / GCC: Led several projects in the offshoring domain, with proven track record of successful business outcomes, for large international enterprises by expanding footprint in areas of finance, accounting, audit, human resources, facilities, compliance, etc. by being an enabler and creating business value for innovation, digitalization for the parent company.<br><br>Business Operations & Transformation: Led various transformational projects, demonstrating a strategic approach to evolving business operations, and ensuring adaptability to changing market dynamics and also enhance operational efficiency and stay at the forefront of technological advancements. My entrepreneurial leadership style is complemented by a keen understanding of organizational architecture, enabling the preparation for rapid change and delivering distinct business differentiators.<