          "employer_linkedin_id": "27515",
          "employer_linkedin_description": "Established in 1975, ITC Hotels Limited has grown to encompass over 150+ hotels across 90+ destinations, solidifying its presence in the Indian subcontinent.ITC Hotels seamlessly blends India’s rich tradition of hospitality with globally benchmarked services, offering a collection of hotels and resorts that reflect the unique culture and ethos of each destination. The group operates under seven vibrant brands: ITC Hotels and Mementos in the luxury segment, Epiq Collection and Welcomhotel in the premium category, Storii in the boutique premium segment, Fortune in the midscale segment, and WelcomHeritage in the heritage leisure space.",
          "employer_logo_url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D560BAQGtHzRcHlpJDA/img-crop_100/img-crop_100/0/1735729617551?e=1749686400&v=beta&t=L854F4SYjSVn72xgzrSkspwa7-OgXor0wTOWaB0YH-w",
