          "employee_position_id": 508760591,
          "employee_title": "Housekeeping Floor Manager",
          "employee_description": "Floor Operations Supervision\n\nOversee day-to-day housekeeping operations on assigned guest floors.\n\nEnsure guest rooms, corridors, pantries, and service areas are cleaned to brand standards.\n\nStaff Management\n\nAllocate duties to Room Attendants, Housemen, and Supervisors.\n\nTrain, motivate, and monitor team performance to ensure high service standards.\n\nGuest Satisfaction & Room Readiness\n\nInspect rooms for cleanliness, maintenance, and amenities before guest check-in.\n\nHandle guest requests and complaints with professionalism and promptness.\n\nQuality Assurance & Standards\n\nConduct regular inspections and audits for hygiene, linen quality, and room set-up.\n\nImplement and maintain standard operating procedures (SOPs) for cleaning and presentation.\n\nInventory Control\n\nMonitor and manage stock levels of linen, amenities, cleaning agents, and housekeeping equipment.\n\nRaise requisitions and ensure efficient usage to control costs.\n\nCoordination with Other Departments\n\nLiaise with Front Office, Engineering, and Laundry to ensure smooth operations.\n\nCoordinate with Maintenance for timely repair of defects in rooms or public areas.\n\nTraining & Grooming\n\nOrganize regular on-the-job training for new staff and refreshers for existing team.\n\nEnsure team follows grooming standards, safety protocols, and hygiene norms.\n\nCompliance and Safety\n\nEnsure adherence to health and safety regulations, fire safety, and security measures.\n\nMaintain cleanliness records, safety logs, and audits as per hotel policy.\n\nVIP & Special Arrangements\n\nPersonally supervise arrangements for VIPs, long-stay guests, or special room requests.\n\nEnsure turndown services and amenities are personalized as per guest profiles.\n\nReporting & Documentation\n\nPrepare shift reports, inspection checklists, lost & found records, and daily handovers.\n\nReport occupancy forecasts and staffing needs to Executive Housekeeper.",
