          "description": "# Acted as a key frontend contributor for multiple client-facing platforms, ensuring high-quality, maintainable React codebases.\n# Drove adoption of reusable component patterns and centralized state management, improving development velocity.\n# Contributed to frontend–backend contract design, improving API usability and reducing integration issues.\n# Built responsive interfaces that supported large datasets and complex user workflows.\n# Collaborated with distributed teams on global products, aligning development with international standards.\n# Supported end-to-end feature development with Node.js and Express, strengthening overall system understanding.",
