          "title": "Next.js Developer",
          "description": "As a Next.js Developer at Bitcot, I focus on building high-performance, SEO-optimized web applications using Next.js, React, and TypeScript. My work emphasizes scalability, modular architecture, and rich user experiences across complex domains like medical data analysis and enterprise platforms. I utilize Server-Side Rendering (SSR), Static Site Generation (SSG), and API routes to improve initial load times, search engine visibility, and dynamic data handling. By combining Tailwind CSS and reusable component systems, I deliver consistent, responsive interfaces that are both visually appealing and developer-friendly. Key contributions include: Optimized performance through dynamic imports, code-splitting, and Next.js image optimization strategies Built reusable layouts and UI components, promoting maintainability and scalability across multiple projects Worked on a medical imaging platform involving DICOM file parsing, SVG/Canvas overlays, and coordinate transformation logic to visualize and analyze spinal measurements Applied advanced concepts in coordinate systems, mathematical calculations, and DOM-SVG interaction to build tools like femoral head analysis with real-time rendering capabilities This role strengthened my ability to write clean, production-ready code while solving domain-specific challenges in performance, visualization, and cross-platform optimization.",
